$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM tert-Butyl
3-[3-(4-Methoxyphenoxy)phenyl]sulfonyl-3-(tetrahydropyran-2-yloxycarbamoyl)-8-azaspiro[4.5]decane-8-carboxylate
(38a). To a solution of compound 37a (160 mg, 0.29 mmol) in DMF (15 mL)
was added EDC·HCl (115.2 mg, 0.6 mmol), HOBt (80 mg, 0.6 mmol), THPONH2
(70.2 mg, 0.6 mmol), and NMM (101 mg, 1.0 mmol), then the mixture was
stirred at RT overnight. The mixture was quenched with water and
extracted with EtOAc, and the organic layer was washed with brine, dried
over anhydrous Na2SO4, and concentrated to give the crude product which
was purified by preparative TLC. the compound 38a (154 mg, 82%) as a
paleyellow solid. MS m/z 505 [M-139] calcd for C33H44N2O9S. This
intermediate was used in the next step without further characterization.
