(relative intensity) 399 (M+, 25), 286 (100), 220 (21), 205 (82), 164
(15), 149 (18), 88 (23). Exact mass (EI) calculated for C25H37NO3 (M+),
399.2773; found, 399.2777. LC/MS analysis (Waters MicroMass ZQ system)
showed purity 96% and retention time 5.7 min for the title compound.
